u0002.presupposition.rendered:
There is a first entity of sort "entity" such that both of the following hold:
  (a) the first entity of sort "entity" has the recorded relation "mission_of" to anthropic;
  (b) for every second entity of sort "entity" that has the recorded relation "mission_of" to anthropic, the second entity of sort "entity" is the same as the first entity of sort "entity".

